  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 9.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Þa unrihtwisan deman hí beoð wyrsan þonne herigende here: here man mæg foroft befleon; ac þa deman for hira anwealde man ne mæg befleon, ðonne he him of hira ceastrewarena forðrycnesse gestreon gaderiað.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Unjust judges are worse than a plundering army. A man may often flee from an army, but from the power of judges no man can flee. Then they oppress the townspeople to gain profit.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Hosticum potest aliquotiens homo fuga uel defensione uitare, prauos iudices non ita potest, quotiens aduersus subditos malis desideriis inflammantur.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
